    { "id": "brief", "x": -540, "y": 0, "w": 440, "text": "My Tab — 13 surfaces, built to DESIGN.md tokens and EXPERIENCE.md behavior.\n\nThese are clickable. On the Claim Board, tap a dish to claim it — two people on the same dish split it, nobody gets bumped. The footer recalculates and the CTA unlocks once nothing is orphaned.\n\nTweak chips above each artboard switch states: locked, quote expired, payment failed, organizer vs participant.\n\nCanonical demo data reconciles exactly: ฿1,840.00 total, Andre owes ฿291.74." },
